                    <ul class="inclusions-list">
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color:#25D366"></i> Transportasi pribadi ber-AC (Bali &amp; Penida)</li>
                        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color:#25D366"></i> Tiket speedboat pulang-pergi</li>
